  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Easy_Emerald/BH_NU_HEADER.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1680\" height=\"424\"></p><p><strong><span style=\"color:#800000;font-size:x-large\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Easy_Emerald/BH_NU_BANNER1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1680\" height=\"212\"></span></strong></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">提供一套介於原版鐵和鑽石之間的標準裝備、工具和武器。不會在世界生成中新增任何礦物，所有材料皆由原版材料合成。還提供用於砍樹、3x3 採礦和 3x3 挖掘的特殊工具套裝。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fclients%252faff.php%253faff%253d3271\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Easy_Emerald/BH_NU_PROMO.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1680\" height=\"283\"></a></span></p><p><strong><span style=\"color:#800000;font-size:x-large\"><span><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Easy_Emerald/BH_NU_BANNER2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1680\" height=\"212\"></span></span></strong></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">- 材料：綠寶石、紅寶石、黑曜石、銅和紫水晶</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">- 原版風格工具：劍、鎬、斧、鏟、鋤和弓</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">- 挖掘機 - 3x3 鏟子</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">- 鐵鎚 - 3x3 鎬子</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">- 帕克斯爾 - 結合斧頭、鏟子和鎬子</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">- 伐木斧 - 嘗試砍倒整棵樹</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">- 原版木材、鐵、金、鑽石和獄髓的範圍工具</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#333\">- 綠寶石健康馬鈴薯 - 營養豐富的馬鈴薯，可短時間提供夜視、生命恢復和飽食效果</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#333\">- 紅寶石戰鬥馬鈴薯 - 營養豐富的馬鈴薯，可短時間提供抗性、力量和抗火效果</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#333\">- 紫水晶幸運馬鈴薯 - 營養豐富的馬鈴薯，可短時間提供幸運效果</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#333\">- 綠寶石珠珠 - 在身上時提供水下呼吸效果</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#333\">- 紅寶石珠珠 - 在身上時提供火焰保護效果</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#333\">- 紫水晶珠珠 - 在身上時提供夜視效果</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><em><strong>** 材料和工具數值可透過設定檔依喜好調整</strong></em></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/487/651/screen-shot-2022-08-16-at-1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"507\" height=\"610\"></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#333;font-size:24px\"><strong style=\"color:#00f;font-size:24px\">製作紅寶石</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/314/267/screen-shot-2020-09-24-at-6.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"373\" height=\"186\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#00f\"><strong>使用鍛造台進行升級：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/324/110/screen-shot-2020-11-22-at-8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"485\" height=\"202\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/324/111/screen-shot-2020-11-22-at-8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"485\" height=\"202\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/324/112/screen-shot-2020-11-22-at-8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"485\" height=\"202\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/399/489/screen-shot-2021-10-06-at-3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"309\" height=\"412\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/j7bYbkW\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Easy_Emerald/BH_NU_BANNER3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1680\" height=\"212\"></a><br></strong></span></p>",
